      "cooked": "<p>I have a requirement in ERPNext and I would like to know the best standard approach for it.</p>\n<p>We have a user in the <strong>Stock / Purchase</strong> department. I want this user to be able to <strong>create a Quality Inspection only from a Purchase Receipt</strong>, but not have full Quality control permissions.</p>\n<p>The process I need is:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Stock / Purchase user creates the <strong>Purchase Receipt</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The same user can create the related <strong>Quality Inspection</strong> from that Purchase Receipt only</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>After that, the <strong>Quality team</strong> completes the inspection and submits/finalizes it</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>What I want to prevent is:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>the Stock / Purchase user creating Quality Inspection manually from anywhere else</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the Stock / Purchase user completing or submitting the inspection</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>giving this user broad Quality permissions</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>So my question is:</p>\n<p><strong>Is there a standard way in ERPNext/Frappe to allow Quality Inspection creation only from Purchase Receipt, while restricting completion/submission to the Quality department?</strong></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/5/c51c6e2ba6c32ee03ce7f42498a6ff0c0c11ee71.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c51c6e2ba6c32ee03ce7f42498a6ff0c0c11ee71\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/5/c51c6e2ba6c32ee03ce7f42498a6ff0c0c11ee71_2_690x146.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"s7IYlRDDUXJFmYjQwd8gpwbRXGh\" width=\"690\" height=\"146\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/5/c51c6e2ba6c32ee03ce7f42498a6ff0c0c11ee71_2_690x146.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/5/c51c6e2ba6c32ee03ce7f42498a6ff0c0c11ee71_2_1035x219.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/5/c51c6e2ba6c32ee03ce7f42498a6ff0c0c11ee71.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F7F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1040×221 22.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
